AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000029> "the Piazza San Marco"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000029> "the cockpit of an aircraft"@en)
